      <h1>Jewellery Brand Marketing Agency in Vadodara 2026 &mdash; Complete FAQ</h1>
      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on hiring a d2c marketing agency for jewellery + fine jewellery brands in Vadodara, India &mdash; costs in INR, compliance (CDSCO + BIS + Gujarat FDA), channels, timelines, and how ITD GrowthLabs approaches this work.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="itdgl-faq-intro">
      <p>Choosing a jewellery marketing agency in Vadodara, India is high-stakes — jewellery has strict compliance (BIS HUID + GIA/IGI + Kimberley Process), longer sales cycles, higher AOV, WhatsApp concierge, wedding-season concentration. Vadodara has India's second-largest chemicals + pharma cluster and a growing digital-first buyer base. Strong pull for skincare + perfume ingredient sourcing. Generic D2C agencies fail jewellery-specific requirements. This FAQ answers 12 questions Vadodara jewellery founders ask about hiring marketing agencies.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-evidence-band">
      <strong>ITD JEWELLERY + D2C PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong>
      This FAQ is grounded in live category work. ITD's jewellery D2C 50-piece cluster + <a href='/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php' style='color:#4338ca;font-weight:700;'>Fabelia D2C case study</a> + <a href='/resources/fine_jewelry_vs_fashion_jewelry_d2c.php' style='color:#4338ca;font-weight:700;'>fine vs fashion jewellery positioning</a> ground this playbook. Every answer below is written from real client engagements and published playbooks, not templated content.
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How to choose a jewellery marketing agency in Vadodara?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">12-point framework: (1) Named jewellery client work + live URLs. (2) Sub-vertical fit (fashion/gold-plated/fine-gold/diamond/bridal/investment/regional-heritage). (3) BIS HUID + GIA/IGI + Kimberley Process compliance familiarity. (4) AR try-on + 360-spin + macro photography expertise. (5) WhatsApp concierge + offline conversion upload for phone/concierge close. (6) Wedding + Akshaya Tritiya + Dhanteras + Diwali peak-season campaign expertise. (7) Celebrity + editorial + Vogue Wedding + Harper's Bazaar Bride + wedding-industry partnerships. (8) Regional-language + trilingual capability. (9) Ad-spend track record (Rs 1 Cr+ annual per client). (10) Multi-touch attribution + 5-year LTV cohort. (11) Founder + senior access. (12) Contract (no markup, 6-month MSA with cancellation, 100% IP, exit clause).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is realistic retainer + ad-spend transparency for jewellery agency in Vadodara?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Retainer: Rs 60,000-2 lakh (Starter to Enterprise). Ad-spend transparent pass-through. Bundled = red flag. Ad-spend: Rs 1-5 lakh/month. Total (retainer + ad-spend + tooling): Rs 2-50 lakh/month Starter to Enterprise. Enterprise + bridal + luxury higher. In Vadodara with Salaried + industrial + educated professional + growing D2C consumer base + Navratri + Diwali + wedding season + Uttarayan concentration, ad-spend spikes 3-5x during wedding + Akshaya Tritiya + Dhanteras + Diwali windows.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What named client work should jewellery agency show?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Verifiable: live URLs of jewellery Shopify + Meta Ads Library + Instagram + certification display, named client references (2-3), case study PDFs with revenue/CAC/LTV/ROAS/wedding-cohort retention. ITD's evidence base: 50-piece jewellery D2C cluster + <a href='/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php'>Fabelia case study</a> + <a href='/resources/fine_jewelry_vs_fashion_jewelry_d2c.php'>fine vs fashion jewellery positioning</a>.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What contract terms + exit clauses for jewellery agency in Vadodara?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">6-month MSA with cancellation after month 3. Ad-spend transparent pass-through. IP ownership 100% client. Data 100% client. Notice 30-60 days. Avoid: 12-24 month lock-in, IP retention, ad-spend markup, unclear termination. For jewellery specifically: customer-data ownership (bridal cohort, buyback programme, insurance) critical — never let agency retain.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What team + pod structure for jewellery agency in Vadodara?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Growth-tier: Account Director + Growth Lead, performance marketer, creative pod (2-3 designers + macro-video + 360-spin coordinator, 8-18 units/week), WhatsApp concierge + inside-sales specialist, SEO + content executor, compliance advisor (BIS HUID + GIA + Kimberley), photography + AR coordinator. Enterprise adds CMO/strategist + celebrity/PR/wedding-industry lead + bridal campaign coordinator + editorial coordinator. In Vadodara, wedding + festive expertise + local jeweller-network essential.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What reporting cadence for jewellery agency in Vadodara?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Weekly: channel + creative + WhatsApp concierge + ROAS + CAC + LTV/CAC + cohort update. Monthly QBR: full P&L + wedding-cohort long-term LTV + concierge-close attribution + creative + celebrity/editorial performance. Quarterly business review + 5-year LTV cohort analysis. Peak-season (Navratri + Diwali + wedding season + Uttarayan) daily performance + wedding-season war-room.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">In-house vs agency vs hybrid for jewellery brand in Vadodara?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">In-house at Rs 40 Cr+/month with 12-18 specialists. Full agency at Rs 40 lakh-40 crore/month. Hybrid (Rs 8-40 Cr/month): CMO/Growth Head in-house + specialist agency execution. In Vadodara with wedding + heritage concentration, local expertise + agency execution combo works especially well.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Founder + senior access for jewellery agency — what to expect?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Non-negotiable — jewellery is high-stakes/high-AOV/long-cycle business, founder-level strategic input essential. Founder/senior on quarterly QBR + monthly strategic review. ITD standard: founder/senior on quarterly QBR + Growth Lead weekly + dedicated Slack/WhatsApp + 24hr SLA + quarterly in-person + wedding-season concierge-training visit.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Attribution + compliance familiarity — what jewellery agency needs?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Attribution: Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions + WhatsApp CTWA + LinkedIn Conversion API + Shopify order-level + offline conversion upload (phone/concierge close — 30-50% attribution loss without) + multi-touch + LTV/CAC/5-year-cohort dashboard. Compliance: BIS HUID (mandatory India), GIA/IGI/HRD gemstone certification, Kimberley Process for diamond, hallmarking centre partnerships, GST 3% gold + 5% making + 25% diamond pricing display, insurance-grade shipping, halal-safe (GCC), Arabic labelling.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What are red flags in jewellery agency proposals?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) 'Industries: 20+' category tourism. (2) No named jewellery case studies. (3) Bundled ad-spend markup. (4) Guaranteed ROAS/leads. (5) 12-24 month lock-in. (6) IP retention. (7) Junior-only team. (8) No BIS HUID + GIA/IGI + Kimberley familiarity. (9) No offline conversion upload capability (misses 30-50% jewellery attribution). (10) English-only creative. (11) No wedding + festive campaign expertise. (12) Cannot articulate multi-touch attribution + 5-year LTV cohort.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Trial period + first 90 days — what to expect from jewellery agency?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Month 1: audit + attribution rebuild (including offline conversion upload setup) + WhatsApp concierge + inside-sales flow design + creative pipeline. Month 2: campaign launch + creative testing + WhatsApp concierge live + first cohort measurement. Month 3: optimise + first QBR + 90-day review + tier recalibration. Milestones day 30/60/90. Cancellation after month 3. Onboarding timing 10-14 weeks before wedding season.</div>
      </div>
